<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35405" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per-purgo</span></b>  (ante-class. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">perpūrĭgo</span></b> , v. Ritschl, Opusc.
		2, 426 sqq.), āvi, ātum, 1, v.
			a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to
				cleanse</i> or <i>purge thoroughly</i>, <i>to make quite clean.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">alvum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 115</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">se,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. N. D. 2, 50, 127</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">perpurgata ulcera,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels.
					5, 26</span></i>
			, n. 36: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">perpurigatis auribus,</span>”
				i. e. <i>with the greatest attention</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Mil. 3, 1, 179</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>to clear up</i>, <i>explain</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">locus orationis perpurgatus ab iis, qui ante me
					dixerunt,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Mur. 26, 54</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crimina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Scaur. 8, 14</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">id. Div. 2, 1, 2</span></i>.—<b>
				<i>Absol.</i>
			</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">de dote tanto magis perpurga,</span>”
				<i>settle</i>, <i>arrange</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Att. 12, 12, 1</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
